<p>I’m new to Third Law, also new to Iris Dark/Black/Etc., and enjoying tales related to both, but I stumbled across this set of tales completely by accident from the Black Queen Hub, and it was a *very* pleasant surprise, especially with this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Hormones, check. (Estrogen, progesterone, spironolactone. She'd been getting them from the Maxwellist Free Clinic on Turing Street since high school.)</p>
