<p>Also just gotta say since this is my first comment on this set of tales, absolutely love what you’ve done with MC&amp;D here, particularly with Dark being the one to tell Marshall and Carter to get with the times instead of the other way around.<br />
+1</p>
<p>(Incidentally this is also my first comment on this site at all, apologies if this comment was in any way awkward or inappropriate)</p>

