<p>First of all, thanks for the crit. Secondly, multiple exploration logs/action scenarios would definitely work with the article, so I'll make sure to add that into the edit. One way I could structure it was this initial exploration log that reveals at least part of the SCP, a drone log that reveals the SCP's agency and malevolence, and a final action scenario that somehow contains the SCP (whether it be through neutralizing it or making a deal with it).</p>
<p>My main idea with the 'festival' was that the fairies have some sort of once in a millennium celebration that requires large amounts of humans to perform. I'm still deciding what exactly the festival's purpose is, but it's definitely not benevolent. Some of the ideas are a coronation of some monarch, a revival of some great being, or a way to connect two dimensions together. Again, those are just some of my ideas.</p>

