<p><br />
The object is a pair of particles in between two separate branching worlds that allow for the communication between these two timelines via the transmission of information (possibly through Morse Code). A researcher by the name of Dr. Underwood attempts to contact her recently-deceased husband's counterpart in the alternate timeline, in a world where she had died rather than him during a similar event (possibly a containment breach, as both had worked together at the foundation when alive). The article contains a record of these messages, as well as documentation of cataclysmic events that transpired as a result of Dr. Underwood's attempts to reconnect with her husband.</p>
